  "description": "Build your legacy from the ground up! In Castle Factory Tycoon, you aren’t just a king—you’re an industrial mastermind. Transform a small plot of land into a sprawling, impenetrable fortress by mastering the art of the forge.\n\nForge. Sell. Expand.\nStart your journey by purchasing your first Droppers. Watch as they churn out essential gear for the realm. From sturdy axes and shields to mystical glowing potions, every item created is gold in your pocket.\n\nMassive Construction.\nWith over 160 unique upgrades and items to buy, your castle will never stop growing. You can even upgrade your upgraders!\n\n\nFeatures:\n>Rebirth System: Reached the top? Reset your progress to earn permanent money multipliers! Every rebirth makes your next empire grow faster and bigger.\n\n>Auto-Save & Load: Your progress is safe with us. Build at your own pace—your kingdom will be waiting exactly where you left it.\n\n>Stunning Visuals: Watch your empty lot evolve into a bustling medieval powerhouse.\n\n\nAre you ready to claim your crown? ",
